<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Showers seen in many parts of Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Showers seen in many parts of Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Monday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		0</p>
<p>    Canyon		    3.8</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     7</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   26.5</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  2.6</p>
<p>    Moussakele		4.6</p>
<p>    Norton		    2.4</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    2.5</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   20.2</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecast thundershowers at several places during the afternoon or evening on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
